     "kind": "event-image"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "Learn more about Eureka Vapor’s great Disposable Vape products … including their 1g and 3g Dual-Flavor Dispos on Friday July 8, 2026 from 4pm – 7pm!"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><strong>Eureka Vapor</strong> is a pioneering, family-owned cannabis brand founded in 2011 that sets the industry standard for high-potency, <strong>award-winning CO₂-extracted cannabis oil vapes</strong>. Operating across major legal markets—including Massachusetts—they are celebrated for their strict “no cutting agents” commitment, ensuring all distillates and live resins are 100% natural and completely free of MCT, PG, VG, or Vitamin E acetate.</p><p><img src=\"assets/source/d75f2e72-Eureka-Dispos-1080x1080-2-300x300.png\" alt=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Eureka-Dispos-1080x1080-2-300x300.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/deea41b9-Eureka-Dispos-1080x1080-2.png\"></p><ul><li><strong>Their Philosophy:</strong> “Loyal to the Oil” — providing access to clean, potent, all-natural medicine you can trust.</li><li><strong>Pure Extraction:</strong> Utilizing proprietary, manually operated supercritical CO₂ extraction to lock in full-spectrum cannabinoids and authentic terpene profiles.</li><li><strong>Hardware Integrity:</strong> 100% lab-tested ceramic hardware guarantees a smooth draw completely free of heavy metal exposure.</li></ul><p><a href=\"/brands/eureka/\"><img src=\"assets/source/d151dbdc-Shop-Now-Button-200px.png\" alt=\"Shop Now at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"200\" height=\"69\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Shop-Now-Button-200px.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\"></a></p>"
    },
